@startuml UC-P2-manage-project-members-design-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
skinparam ParticipantPadding 6
title UC-P2 Manage project members (design sequence, planned)
' Design level (decision 9), drawn against docs/domain/diagrams/projects-design.puml (decisions 13 and 14).
' The analysis level is UC-P2-manage-project-members-analysis-sequence.puml.
' Step ids are the main flow numbers of UC-P2. PLANNED, NOT BUILT.
' Before step 2 the composition root runs the full check (token, account found, not deactivated, not pending)
' and builds the Caller. That check is the account routes' check and is not drawn.
' Order: may see (404), then may change (403), then the input (422). Authorisation comes before validation.
' Opening the member list (step 1) is UC-P3. Not drawn: adding a person who is already a member, which changes
' nothing and writes no entry.
' Steps 6 and 7 are one transaction: SqlProjects and the AuditLog adapter share one database session.
' Answers are mapped to HTTP in main.py: ProjectNotFound 404, NotAnAdministrator 403, MemberNotEligible 422.

actor "Caller\n(person)" as U
participant "Projects-\nService" as S #E7F4EA
participant "Project-\nRepository" as R #EEE7F7
participant "Project-\nRules" as PR #FFE6CC
participant "Project" as J #FFE6CC
participant "Account-\nStatus" as AS #EEE7F7
participant "AuditLog" as AL #EEE7F7

U -> S : 2 add_member or remove_member\n(caller, project_id, account_id)
S -> R : 4 get(project_id)
R --> S : the project, or none
S -> PR : 4 may_see(caller, project)
alt no project, or neither a member\nnor an administrator
  S --> U : 4 ProjectNotFound (404, the same for both)
else
  S -> PR : 4 may_change_members(caller)
  alt a member, not an administrator
    S --> U : 4 NotAnAdministrator (403)
  else add
    S -> AS : 5 active_among({account_id})
    alt not active, or unknown
      S --> U : 5 MemberNotEligible (422)
    else
      S -> J : 6 add_member(account_id, added_by)
      S -> R : 6 save(project)
      S -> AL : 7 record(who, member added, whom)
      S --> U : updated member list
    end
  else remove
    S -> J : 6 remove_member(account_id)
    alt not a member (a Projects rule,\nAccountStatus is not asked)
      S --> U : 6 MemberNotEligible (422)
    else
      S -> R : 6 save(project)
      S -> AL : 7 record(who, member removed, whom)
      S --> U : updated member list
    end
  end
end
@enduml
